>> title: Buttermilk Pancakes
>> servings: 4
>> source: Chowdown sample

Whisk @flour{200%g}, @baking powder{2%tsp}, @sugar{1%tbsp} and @salt{1/2%tsp} in a #large bowl{}.

In a separate #jug{}, beat @eggs{2} into the @buttermilk{300%ml}.

Pour the wet mix into the dry and fold until just combined (lumps are fine). Rest the batter for ~{10%minutes}.

Heat a #frying pan{} over medium and add a little @butter{}. Ladle in the batter and cook for ~{2%minutes} until bubbles form, then flip and cook ~{1%minute} more.

Serve with @maple syrup{} and @fresh berries{}.
